 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the corner of your desktop, a tiny space farmer responds to every click and keystroke you make throughout the day. You don\u2019t need to pay attention, he takes care of planting and harvesting on his own.\u00a0As you harvest space plants, you'll earns credits you can then use, along with your  inputs, to upgrade his tools, crops, home, and spaceship. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PERSONALIZATION</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to personalize your farmer? Unlock a variety of charming hats as you go and choose between two different characters. They won\u2019t boost performance, but they\u2019ll definitely boost style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LIGHTWIGHT AND COZY</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Harvest is an idle game with no intrusive menus, no pop-ups, and no stress. Lightweight, cozy, always present\u2014like a virtual houseplant that thrives quietly while you go about your day.</p>","developers":["JanduSoft","Eric Rodr\u00edguez"],"dlc":[3918720],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896460/60a0a10fe617310754a081f24c8f60dd47b18680/header.jpg?t=1766572533","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3896460/1877951492/c21dd8be9e77c8804d9d8258bc933d5f0d109b2e/1753869722/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756115629","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3896460/1877951492/c21dd8be9e77c8804d9d8258bc933d5f0d109b2e/1753869722/